# decompress_420 slices: rows are processed per chroma row y = START/2 .. END/2 - 1 (integer division),
# i.e. START rounds DOWN to an even row, END rounds DOWN too: an odd END drops the last (incomplete) pair.
# Unprocessed output stays ee. Input 4x4: Y=01..10, U=aa bb 11 22, V=cc dd 33 44 (chroma stride 2).
decompress 420 0 4 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
decompress 420 0 2 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
decompress 420 2 4 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
# odd START (1) behaves like 0; odd END (3) behaves like 2; (1,3) = (0,2)
decompress 420 1 4 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
decompress 420 0 3 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
decompress 420 1 3 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
decompress 420 3 4 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
# empty
decompress 420 2 2 4 2 2 16 4 0102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f10 aabb1122 ccdd3344
